5552.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105552.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-28T00:27:05Z"},"body":"* Change `get_node_list()` to return `Vector<StringName>` instead of filling user-allocated `List<StringName>`.\r\n* Expose `AnimationNodeStateMachine::get_node_list()` and `AnimationNodeBlendTree::get_node_list()`. This requires an intermediary function, that creates a `TypedArray`.\r\n\r\nThe first change is not really necessary, but it makes it a bit more consistent with how `VisualShader::get_node_list` works, which is a similar function I guess.\r\n\r\nIf you're wondering about a use case for this - I needed to retrieve names of all states, so I can internally assign an ID to each of them and then transfer that information between client and server. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105552/timeline","pe